@startuml
[*] --> WaitingState : Initial State
WaitingState --> ActiveState : Current date equals or surpasses start date
ActiveState --> ExpiredState : Finish date reached
ExpiredState --> [*] : One year from expiration date

note right of ExpiredState: Archived state (substate)
note left of ExpiredState: Possible substates for expired and archived states

ActiveState --> ActiveState : Validity period extended (no change in state)

note right of WaitingState: Start date arrival event
note left of ActiveState: Current date equals or surpasses start date event
note right of ExpiredState: Finish date reached event
note left of ExpiredState: One year from expiration date event

@enduml
